{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/a8af6ec7ee590d72fcde21959af00f6e.poster.avif?t=1759944355\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/a8af6ec7ee590d72fcde21959af00f6e.webm?t=1759944355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/a8af6ec7ee590d72fcde21959af00f6e.mp4?t=1759944355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/29fec0b0f4a91e2f0c74fa20f68465c3.webp?t=1759944355\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming mistresses have gathered here, coming from all corners of the Eight Kingdoms - places full of forbidden desires and treacherous secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/163a36ff7df38acb485fc383076cf35e.avif?t=1759944355\" width=620 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/636c8d3f91715a71ebb1c6a76e4a6571.avif?t=1759944355\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/5ab5e2bbc3345e34c0b8fbfae70db9dc.avif?t=1759944355\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One tragedy changes everything: a young ruler, the beloved Emperor, suddenly dies, and all the inhabitants of the Kingdom plunge into deep mourning, leaving his harem - the heart of the Empire - unprotected.<br><br>At this critical point for the Eight Kingdoms, fate leads you, a young healer, there. You, who is destined to take care of the sexiest, most beautiful and, at the same time, most dangerous women of the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2753<i> Will your hands be able to heal not only the body, but also the hearts and souls of the beauties? </i><br><br>\u2753<i> Who will fall under your seduction, and whose seduction will bring you down? </i><br> <br>    \u2753<i> Will you be able to unravel the conspiracies, stay alive and perhaps seize power over the Celestial Empire?Massages, elixirs, secret dates, and treacherous plans \u2014 all this awaits you behind the gates of the harem. Seduce. Heal. Investigate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massages, elixirs, secret dates, and treacherous plans \u2014 all this awaits you behind the gates of the harem. Seduce. Heal. Investigate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/3d359a1001c97a9b86a6a1516a682484.webp?t=1759944355\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3299\ufe0f A fantasy Ancient Asia setting<br>\ud83c\udf38 Hot girls with unique personalities<br>\ud83c\udf5c Delicate art with an Asian style vibe<br>\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f Lots of H-scenes, fully animated and voiced<br>\ud83c\udfad Various text based mini-games<br>\u26a1 6 different endings<br>\u262f\ufe0f <i>The game features optional femboy and futa characters: you can choose if you want to see H-scenes with them or not</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 THE HAREM AWAITS ITS NEW RULER \ud83d\udc51</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951710/extras/6578ddaed849839248b80